abstract: "Code, derived inputs and result tables for label diagnostics of spatial reference annotations and for an attribution protocol that compares spatial encoders (Tessera-ST, GraphST and STAGATE) with parameter-free propagation on their own graphs. Software licensing applies to author-owned code; third-party measurements and annotations retain their source-specific rights."
